WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.377
Today we will compose a simple shared musical phrase. Our work connects with Ghanaian

00:00:05.377 --> 00:00:06.856
and other African artists.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:11.177
Write or say a short call about caring for people or places.

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:17.330
Invent an easy response of similar length. Record why your chosen technique suits the

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:17.708
message.

00:00:18.533 --> 00:00:21.627
Practise taking turns as leader and responding group.
